4,Folk Music of Sikkim: A Cultural Tapestry - Orchids Intl,https://www.orchidsinternationalschool.com/blog/folk-song-of-sikkim,"Sep 16, 2024 · Their cultures constitute the folk dances and music of the Sikkimese area. Their music and folk dances depict the beauty of the natural habitat, illustrate the harvest season, and are performed for good luck and prosperity.",Sikkimese,Sino-Tibetan
